    "type": "game",
    "name": "Crocogame",
    "steam_appid": 2486760,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486760/extras/1f45972f17b90e44260c3c6e3f3f4b5e.poster.avif?t=1740473786\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486760/extras/1f45972f17b90e44260c3c6e3f3f4b5e.?t=1740473786\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crocogame is a fast-paced roguelite game with rewarding difficulty progression. The player controls cute crocos, with unique stats and ultimate spells in order to defeat deadly enemies on various challenging maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FOCUS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is balanced around intense moment-to-moment combat, where movement and attack resources must be used efficiently to achieve victory. A big part of the game's progression revolves around stackable difficulty modifiers, which can turn every map harder in exchange for new, cool rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER CUSTOMISATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During gameplay, the player upgrades impactful stats and collects gameplay-altering essences. As the difficulty modifiers stack up, more essence slots are unlocked, leading to unique build combinations with unexpected synergies and explosive results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486760/extras/e6a963097096fa0af270dd55b1aae968.poster.avif?t=1740473786\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486760/extras/e6a963097096fa0af270dd55b1aae968.webm?t=1740473786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast runs (~15 minutes each).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10 build-defining stats you can upgrade every time you level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 6 unique crocos with diverse base stats and ultimate spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 70+ powerful essences with gameplay-altering effects. You can combine up to 4 of them to create unique builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 playable maps with different challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10 difficulty modifiers for each map to put your skills to the test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Achievement-based progression. Unlock new crocos, essences, maps and difficulty points by completing achievements on different difficulty levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenging normal and elite enemies with diverse movesets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Twin-stick controls for complete immersion in the action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you climb to the top and complete all the maps at the highest difficulty level?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486760/extras/e1cff8cca8ffd65ee1f154b6464314be.poster.avif?t=1740473786\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486760/extras/e1cff8cca8ffd65ee1f154b6464314be.webm?t=1740473786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486760/extras/e1cff8cca8ffd65ee1f154b6464314be.mp4?t=1740473786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486760/extras/1f45972f17b90e44260c3c6e3f3f4b5e.poster.avif?t=1740473786\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486760/extras/1f45972f17b90e44260c3c6e3f3f4b5e.?t=1740473786\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crocogame is a fast-paced roguelite game with rewarding difficulty progression. The player controls cute crocos, with unique stats and ultimate spells in order to defeat deadly enemies on various challenging maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FOCUS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is balanced around intense moment-to-moment combat, where movement and attack resources must be used efficiently to achieve victory. A big part of the game's progression revolves around stackable difficulty modifiers, which can turn every map harder in exchange for new, cool rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER CUSTOMISATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During gameplay, the player upgrades impactful stats and collects gameplay-altering essences. As the difficulty modifiers stack up, more essence slots are unlocked, leading to unique build combinations with unexpected synergies and explosive results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486760/extras/e6a963097096fa0af270dd55b1aae968.poster.avif?t=1740473786\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486760/extras/e6a963097096fa0af270dd55b1aae968.webm?t=1740473786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast runs (~15 minutes each).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10 build-defining stats you can upgrade every time you level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 6 unique crocos with diverse base stats and ultimate spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 70+ powerful essences with gameplay-altering effects. You can combine up to 4 of them to create unique builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 playable maps with different challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10 difficulty modifiers for each map to put your skills to the test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Achievement-based progression. Unlock new crocos, essences, maps and difficulty points by completing achievements on different difficulty levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenging normal and elite enemies with diverse movesets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Twin-stick controls for complete immersion in the action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you climb to the top and complete all the maps at the highest difficulty level?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486760/extras/e1cff8cca8ffd65ee1f154b6464314be.poster.avif?t=1740473786\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486760/extras/e1cff8cca8ffd65ee1f154b6464314be.webm?t=1740473786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486760/extras/e1cff8cca8ffd65ee1f154b6464314be.mp4?t=1740473786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
